  "title": "QXO and TopBuild Announce Stockholder Election Results for Merger Consideration",
  "summary": "QXO, Inc. (NYSE: QXO) (“QXO”) and TopBuild Corp. (NYSE: BLD) (“TopBuild”) today announced the results of TopBuild stockholders’ elections regarding the form of merger consideration (the “Merger Consideration”) to be received in connection with QXO’s acquisition of TopBuild (the “Transaction”). As previously disclosed, the deadline for making an election was 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time on June 29, 2026 (the “Election Deadline”). The parties expect the Transaction to close on or about July 1, 2026, sub",
